== Notes ==

* Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* This is the only unique [[ranger]] spell.
* [[Ranged weapon]]s cannot be targeted by this spell.
* [[Bite item|Bite]] and [[claw item]]s cannot be targeted by this spell (but any other standard slashing melee weapon used as a [[natural weapon]] can be, if the spell is cast on the creature).
* Contrary to the spell's description this spell lasts for two [[round]]s per level instead of one.
* This will replace any existing temporary enhancement bonus (e.g. from [[greater magic weapon]]).

